it's a show that examines
famous photographs

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.090
and unpacks the historical
context around them.

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:38.370
- In doing so, we reveal what these photos

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.260
can tell us about our history,

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:42.720
but also how we view ourselves.

